Third-party software
--------------------

Compa's programs include third-party software: Go modules and the Go standard
library, and in compa's web UI npm packages and the Inter font. Each release
archive lists them in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, with their license texts and where
to get their source; cmd/notices writes that file when a release is built.

The WhatsApp channel (pkg/channels/whatsapp) links go.mau.fi/libsignal, which
is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3. Every build of
compa and compa-kernel includes it, release builds too. Anyone who distributes
these programs must do so under the terms of the GPL-3.0.
